# Note: Found with vitacheat v360 z04 (maidump).
#       Per-character values advance by +0x10D8 from the Asuka entry.
#       Scroll and status-ailment addresses shift per stage and per
#       character, so they must be searched each time: search the value
#       43FA0000 in the range 84000000-85000000; an address ending in 08
#       minus 0x10 is the current scroll value and +0x04 is its maximum.
#       Writing FFFFFFFF at (scroll max + 0x90) gives super armour.

